<title>RUSSIA: Russian central bank refinancing rate changes.</title>
<headline>Russian central bank refinancing rate changes.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following lists changes in the Central Bank of Russia's refinancing rate.</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>    Oct 21     60 vs 80</p>
<p>    Aug 19     80 vs 110</p>
<p>    July 24   110 vs 120</p>
<p>    Feb 10    120 vs 160</p>
<p>1995</p>
<p>    Dec 1     160 vs 170</p>
<p>    Oct 24    170 vs 180</p>
<p>    June 20   180 vs 195</p>
<p>    May 16    195 vs 200</p>
<p>    Jan 6     200 vs 180</p>
<p>1994</p>
<p>    Nov 17    180 vs 170</p>
<p>    Oct 11    170 vs 130</p>
<p>    Aug 22    130 vs 155</p>
<p>    June 30   155 vs 170</p>
<p>    June 22   170 vs 185</p>
<p>    May 16    200 vs 205</p>
<p>April 29  205 vs 210</p>
</text>
